{"id": 18, "name": "Layla", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/5/58/Hero181-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141031", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Finisher", "Damage"], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["10", "80", "10", "10"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "The backbone of the Eruditio Rangers who is also known as the Shining Star.", "skills": [{"name": "Malefic Gun", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ba25b082b2a373138d398a32499e0544.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Layla deals increased damage to enemies farther away from her (starting at 100% and increasing to 115% at 6 units away). This does not include Turrets."}, {"name": "Malefic Bomb", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b00ff9edafd44eeee4af815f24c14653.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6   Mana Cost: 35", "desc": "Layla fires a Malefic Bomb in the target direction, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the first enemy hit (can Crit).\n\nUpon hitting an enemy, Layla's Basic Attacks and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Void Projectile</span> gain extra range for 3s, and she gains 60% extra Movement Speed that decays over 1.2s. The duration of the Movement Speed boost is doubled if an enemy hero is hit."}, {"name": "Void Projectile", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_03f3b37b699108735c77c0197acac646.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7.5   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Layla fires an orb of Malefic Energy at the target enemy that explodes on hit, dealing 170<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+65% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to targets in the area and applying a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Magic Mark</span> on them for 3s.\nWhen Layla hits an enemy with a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Magic Mark</span>, she deals 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+35% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to nearby enemies and stuns them for 0.25s."}, {"name": "Destruction Rush", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8410070e72f25785078a91c793a39cc0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 37   Mana Cost: 130", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: The range of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Void Projectile</span> and Basic Attacks is increased by 0.6 units. Layla's sight range is slightly increased each time this skill is upgraded. \n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Layla fires a blast of Malefic Energy in the target direction, dealing 500<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+150% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a line."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Swift Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b31a355cc85682eed8d9e0dc163fd756.png"}, {"name": "Windtalker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9c06b97bb75d8a81e28a87df1ab92193.png"}, {"name": "Haas' Claws", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_139190ae1087ea51233fdbefb1bbbf5b.png"}, {"name": "Berserker's Fury", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_020f531307fa505083b791e6f3093eb4.png"}, {"name": "Malefic Gun", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_05092a6a401a83fd4c6dea577ffd6ed4.png"}